     1228          FRAME d-trn-pr:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE.
     1229   define variable vss-include-info14 as character format "x(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     1230   on F9 of frame d-trn-pr anywhere do:
